bDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134503814,imgsize-108200.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[11 killed, 30 injured in blast in Pakistan's Dera Ismail Khan]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134503303.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/11-dead-in-suicide-bomb-blast-near-police-post-in-northwestern-pakistan/articleshow/134503303.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/11-dead-in-suicide-bomb-blast-near-police-post-in-northwestern-pakistan/articleshow/134503303.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T16:50:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134504063,imgsize-38641.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Diana after Diana: How her story kept changing long after her death]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134502568.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Diana Frances Spencer, known as Princess Diana, remains a significant figure even after her tragic death. Various individuals and institutions construct different portrayals of her character and life experiences. Her brother Charles Spencer recently published a memoir that reflects on her legacy and relationships. Diana's influence persists, shaping identities and resonating in communities around the world.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/diana-after-diana-how-her-story-kept-changing-long-after-her-death/articleshow/134502568.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/diana-after-diana-how-her-story-kept-changing-long-after-her-death/articleshow/134502568.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T16:44:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134502671,imgsize-129620.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A rubber hose inspired this footwear brand in 2010; 16 years later, Kylian Mbappé has joined its $10B empire]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134502675.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[On, the Swiss footwear brand renowned for its cutting-edge running shoe technology, has successfully broadened its horizons into lifestyle sports and apparel, leading to its public listing. Recently, star footballer Kylian Mbappé joined forces with On, enabling him to influence product creation and strategies for their upcoming football division, with new cleats set for launch in 2027.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/in-2010-a-rubber-hose-persuaded-a-retired-athlete-to-found-a-footwear-firm-16-years-on-its-a-multi-billion-dollar-company-that-kylian-mbapp-signed-with/articleshow/134502675.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/in-2010-a-rubber-hose-persuaded-a-retired-athlete-to-found-a-footwear-firm-16-years-on-its-a-multi-billion-dollar-company-that-kylian-mbapp-signed-with/articleshow/134502675.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T16:18:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134502741,imgsize-695921.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bangladesh jewellery shop owner's body found inside floating drum; Hindu credit union token in pocket]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134502587.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/bangladesh-jewellery-shop-owners-body-found-inside-floating-drum-hindu-credit-union-token-in-pocket/articleshow/134502587.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/bangladesh-jewellery-shop-owners-body-found-inside-floating-drum-hindu-credit-union-token-in-pocket/articleshow/134502587.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T16:13:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134502680,imgsize-83852.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[CNN barred from Trump’s Air Force One trip to Tennessee despite court order restoring White House access]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134502110.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/cnn-barred-from-trumps-air-force-one-trip-to-tennessee-despite-court-order-restoring-white-house-access/articleshow/134502110.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/cnn-barred-from-trumps-air-force-one-trip-to-tennessee-despite-court-order-restoring-white-house-access/articleshow/134502110.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T15:50:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134502334,imgsize-638339.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA["Just get up and walk out": Elon Musk’s unusual meeting rule for Tesla employees]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134500283.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Elon Musk underscores the significance of productivity during meetings, urging team members to exit if they feel unable to contribute. He views long meetings as a hindrance and advocates for shorter, more impactful sessions. Additionally, Musk pushes for transparent communication among employees, encouraging messages to circumvent hierarchical protocols. Clarity in language, free from jargon, is also stressed to boost efficiency.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/just-get-up-and-walk-out-elon-musks-unusual-meeting-rule-for-tesla-employees-and-why-he-called-staying-when-you-add-no-value-rude/articleshow/134500283.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/just-get-up-and-walk-out-elon-musks-unusual-meeting-rule-for-tesla-employees-and-why-he-called-staying-when-you-add-no-value-rude/articleshow/134500283.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T13:36:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134500346,imgsize-729750.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[California homeowner finds remains of 2006 murder victim under house; ex-husband arrested]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134498882.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-california-homeowner-was-checking-the-crawl-space-beneath-his-house-and-discovered-the-remains-of-a-29-year-old-woman-killed-in-2006-years-later-police-arrested-her-ex-husband/articleshow/134498882.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-california-homeowner-was-checking-the-crawl-space-beneath-his-house-and-discovered-the-remains-of-a-29-year-old-woman-killed-in-2006-years-later-police-arrested-her-ex-husband/articleshow/134498882.cms]]></guid><pubDat