ed AI photo of family members wearing ‘Lake America’ sweatshirts loses job; she says it was just for fun, not a political message]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134492190.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/michigan-ceo-who-posted-ai-photo-of-family-members-wearing-lake-america-sweatshirts-loses-job-she-says-it-was-just-for-fun-not-a-political-message/articleshow/134492190.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/michigan-ceo-who-posted-ai-photo-of-family-members-wearing-lake-america-sweatshirts-loses-job-she-says-it-was-just-for-fun-not-a-political-message/articleshow/134492190.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T01:57:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134492196,imgsize-56814.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2024, Iowa farmer Evie Haupt earned $35,000 yearly from 3 turbines, cutting debt to $67,000]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134492075.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Evie Haupt, an Iowa farmer, has notably increased her revenue by leasing land for wind turbines. This extra income has been instrumental in alleviating her farm debts following her husband's passing. Even though the turbines occupy less than an acre, she continues her traditional farming practices on the bulk of her land. The rise of wind power is transforming the financial prospects for rural landowners nationwide.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2024-75-year-old-iowa-farmer-evie-haupt-said-three-wind-turbines-on-her-160-acres-were-bringing-in-about-35000-a-year-while-using-under-3-acres-and-had-helped-reduce-350000-in-farm-debt-to-67000/articleshow/134492075.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2024-75-year-old-iowa-farmer-evie-haupt-said-three-wind-turbines-on-her-160-acres-were-bringing-in-about-35000-a-year-while-using-under-3-acres-and-had-helped-reduce-350000-in-farm-debt-to-67000/articleshow/134492075.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T01:48:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134492172,imgsize-798748.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Goulburn’s 300 local investors funded a 1.4MW solar farm and 4MWh battery over 12 years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134491021.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Residents of Goulburn embarked on an inspiring decade-long endeavor to establish a community-driven solar farm alongside a battery system. With the backing of about 300 local investors, they overcame significant obstacles such as regulatory hurdles and supply chain challenges. Ultimately, the solar farm commenced operations, contributing clean energy to the local grid, and stands as an exemplary model for community-led renewable energy initiatives throughout regional Australia.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-2014-a-small-group-in-goulburn-began-pursuing-a-community-owned-solar-farm-12-years-later-300-mostly-local-investors-had-raised-3-3-million-and-the-1-4mw-plant-with-a-4mwh-battery-opened/articleshow/134491021.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-2014-a-small-group-in-goulburn-began-pursuing-a-community-owned-solar-farm-12-years-later-300-mostly-local-investors-had-raised-3-3-million-and-the-1-4mw-plant-with-a-4mwh-battery-opened/articleshow/134491021.cms]]></guid><pubDat